# Tests & Documentation

## Tests

- Every new Service method with branching logic needs unit tests.
- Every bug fix needs a regression test.
- Utilities and SDK client helpers need unit tests.
- Prefer deterministic tests (no real network); mock at repository/HTTP boundaries.
- Do not delete failing tests to “make CI green”; fix the code or update assertions with justification.

## Documentation

- Update `README.md` / `CONTRIBUTING.md` when developer workflows change.
- Add or update ADRs under `docs/adr/` for architectural decisions.
- Document public package exports and env vars in `.env.example`.
- Keep module README notes accurate when creating new backend modules.
- Cursor rules under `.cursor/rules/` must stay aligned with architecture decisions.
